   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_510c765f211f334349ea",
   "sourceHash": "510c765f211f334349ea628fdaf21b83b13865b58b3f73457eae254959afb844",
   "text": "Beoordelingen worden geladen…",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5350a63171a037eca926",
   "sourceHash": "5350a63171a037eca926bbaf454c3290da2c93496295b738cf30c29e8f2af492",
   "text": "Opnieuw proberen te laden",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_40f69fa2cb372d60e093",
   "sourceHash": "40f69fa2cb372d60e093b8011fdee8daae96873624e65b420e4f380a9e470ed8",
   "text": "Google-beoordelingen tonen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5edce5c6b1409484d11f",
   "sourceHash": "5edce5c6b1409484d11fd47e8e7a1d6afbc02dd6f57660fb6d183eb1174c3741",
   "text": "Beoordelingen worden geladen vanuit Google Maps…",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e2121a7419ac828ab40e",
   "sourceHash": "e2121a7419ac828ab40e6066d959a3f54c305172da3117bd9b7db1f9d25b315f",
   "text": "Het beoordelingspaneel is op dit moment niet beschikbaar. U kunt alle beoordelingen nog steeds rechtstreeks op Google Maps lezen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b29cf705a0386aeeca5d",
   "sourceHash": "b29cf705a0386aeeca5d27a3d64a4c4e94484e6efd8e3eb5525ddf5856038f5a",
   "text": "beoordelingen op Google Maps",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ea37d6d9f4aa220b5e2a",
   "sourceHash": "ea37d6d9f4aa220b5e2aa3292a213ee83fb12cb8183aa0938a95b64c793a7af0",
   "text": "Maximaal vijf beoordelingen, door Google op relevantie gesorteerd. Er wordt niet gefilterd op aantal sterren.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_14c5b4eec60e4457ee7b",
   "sourceHash": "14c5b4eec60e4457ee7b595123e8412e8b75a5fed111ff1d961e90d89aabc3a2",
   "text": "Er zijn in dit paneel geen beoordelingen beschikbaar. Open Google Maps om het volledige overzicht te bekijken.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6f9d01196b1f8d4e5fe8",
   "sourceHash": "6f9d01196b1f8d4e5fe8baad1a87f96693946194b3aec5157947f1bcbeb054ba",
   "text": "Deze bezoeker heeft een waardering gegeven zonder geschreven beoordeling.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest' rendered as 'bezoeker' (visitor) per KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_229a524d2b922f39129b",
   "sourceHash": "229a524d2b922f39129b2c4d0a49924ec807720fe5ebe8fd23e77d36004ea628",
   "text": "Vertaald door Google · origineel bekijken",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bf205dead12f53765dcf",
   "sourceHash": "bf205dead12f53765dcfb874b326e5d7c68e118721a88eaef0928aa2dbf04ecf",
   "text": "Lezen op Google Maps ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8adb4d5967e26ca6e3cd",
   "sourceHash": "8adb4d5967e26ca6e3cde53fdf70f9a5a1765c3c592810e3e90790b0a52714d6",
   "text": "Beoordelingen aangeleverd door Google Maps. Google controleert op nepcontent en verwijdert deze wanneer die wordt vastgesteld; beoordelingen worden niet door Google geverifieerd.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a14d8afeac52cc8e7ca1",
   "sourceHash": "a14d8afeac52cc8e7ca19dad4d2c8be48a299f01ea2a0b85969b70c655d84814",
   "text": "Alle Google-beoordelingen lezen ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cd8401f0d92cc92c526b",
   "sourceHash": "cd8401f0d92cc92c526bab1054fe06d950249adf960ef59df20b4c408d45d4cf",
   "text": "Ervaringen van reizigers",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0ff9b33b4f8f7de49227",
   "sourceHash": "0ff9b33b4f8f7de492277e5d7fb2dd97186da1277318f4dfcd8fcd46889d752e",
   "text": "Bekijk beoordelingen, waarderingen en foto's van bezoekers op de Tripadvisor-pagina van de instelling.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'traveller reviews' and 'guest photographs' merged as 'beoordelingen ... en foto's van bezoekers'; 'guest' rendered as 'bezoekers' and 'property' as 'instelling' per KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
